.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# A dossier embeds the FULL TEXT of every rule file it discovers: your global
# CLAUDE.md, your project CLAUDE.md, your personal skills, and the skills of
# every plugin you have enabled. A run from inside this repo produced 90,533
# bytes of exactly that, including a Tailscale hostname, a NAS host and two
# private marketplace names.
#
# So: ignore every JSON except the two manifests this plugin actually ships.
# If a future file genuinely needs tracking, un-ignore it by name, deliberately.
*.json
!.claude-plugin/plugin.json
!.claude-plugin/marketplace.json

# Evaluations quote the rules they compared against, for the same reason.
evaluations/

# Full-size logo sources (about 2 MB each). The README uses assets/logo.webp.
assets/source/
